# Closest Cities

There are $$$n$$$ cities located on the number line, the $$$i$$$-th city is in the point $$$a_i$$$. The coordinates of the cities are given in ascending order, so $$$a_1 \lt a_2 \lt \dots \lt a_n$$$.

